  "description": "All Mountains, Any Adventure\n\nBalanced Performance\n\n142mm rear suspension and 150mm front suspension coupled with Delano Peaks award-winning frame geometry are the perfect recipe for a perfect day on the trails.\n\nCleancast™ Carbon Frame\n\nOur unique carbon layup process cuts excess waste by 30% while still increasing strength and reducing weight, making our bikes both lighter and more environmentally-friendly.\n\nProven TetraLink™ Platform\n\nSnappy and energetic when you’re pedaling or pumping through rollers, yet composed and confident when the trail gets rough. It pops off rocks and roots with ease, then progressively soaks up bumps and landings to keep you centered and in control on every ride.\n\nClean and Quiet by Design\n\nClean-catch internal cable routing keeps everything tidy and rattle-free, giving you a truly silent ride even over the roughest terrain. A rubberized chainstay protector and downtube guard add extra defense against rock strikes and chain slap, ensuring your bike stays protected and quiet mile after mile.",
